From a5db3a17630b1f99e0fc14e9f01e535339392609 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 14:43:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): sidebar row shows open and blocked kanban task
 counts after the age [daveey]

Session-list rows now also carry kanban_blocked (blocked tasks the session
created or subscribed to). The row renders the open count (project glyph)
and blocked count (amber ?) after the timestamp and before the gateway glyph,
with a tooltip; zero sides are hidden.
